<Base title="About Benito and Bryan, Sacramento Painters" description="Meet Benito and Bryan, the father-and-son crew behind B&amp;S Painting in Sacramento, and learn how they started the company." seo={{ type: "AboutPage" }}><section class="section"><p class="eyebrow">Our family</p><h1>Benito <em>&amp; Bryan.</em></h1><div class="story"><img class="aboutimg" src={projects[0].image} alt={projects[0].title}/><div><h2>Two generations of painters.</h2><p>Benito began painting Sacramento-area homes in 1992. Over the years, he became a superintendent, managing residential and HOA projects across the region.</p><p>Bryan joined him on summer breaks at age 13. By 21 he was running his own crew, and later became a superintendent himself. In 2022, father and son founded B&amp;S Painting Inc.</p><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Talk to B&amp;S</a></div></div></section></Base>
